	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r19r0101_infomationw_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　いっしょ　なんだ！▼
じゃあ　これは　はなむけ！
えんりょせずに　もっていって▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T06:02:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　一緒なんだ！▼
じゃあ　これは　はなむけ！
遠慮せずに　持っていって▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-27T06:02:15" />
